{'symbol': 'CLX', 'date': '2021-09-23 06:30:00', 'title': 'EPA NAMES CLOROX SAFER CHOICE PARTNER OF THE YEAR FOR LEADERSHIP IN ADVANCING SAFER INGREDIENTS, PRODUCTS', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF., SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE CLOROX COMPANY (NYSE: CLX) WAS NAMED A 2021 SAFER CHOICE PARTNER OF THE YEAR AWARD WINNER FOR OUTSTANDING ACHIEVEMENT IN THE MANUFACTURING OF PRODUCTS WITH INGREDIENTS THAT ARE SAFER FOR FAMILIES, PETS, WORKPLACES, COMMUNITIES, AND THE ENVIRONMENT.'}